# The Weaponsmith activates only in its controller's upkeep, tapping and sacrificing exactly one artifact to put one counter on either player's creature (CR 602.2b, 701.21a, 122.1).
# Once both artifacts are gone, an attempted activation cannot finish payment and rolls back (CR 733).
[Bot1 Deck]
Dwarven Weaponsmith
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mountain
Mountain x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20
